<title>UK: BOE ALLOTS 762 MLN STG IN OUTRIGHT BILLS, REPO.</title>
<headline>BOE ALLOTS 762 MLN STG IN OUTRIGHT BILLS, REPO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 762 million stg of assistance.</p>
<p>It allotted 67 million stg in bills outright and 695 million stg in repos to repos to August 28 and September 1.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
